comments[9]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-05T09:16:32.864Z","harness:codex","TDD evidence: 40 serves over 10,000 candidates produced 18,331,640 ledger bytes before the change. The new bounded persistence regression passes below 262,144 bytes with at most 256 recorded candidate rows. Final-egress delivery remains required for affinity; unrecorded sample rows cannot earn fabricated exposure credit."
  "2026-09-05T09:57:31.310Z","harness:codex","Scale evidence: 40 serves at each of 10k/100k/1m candidates wrote a mean 18129/18141/18143 ledger bytes, compacted twice per tier, and ended below 238k bytes. Four concurrent writers measured peak lock waits of 99/283/1794ms. Full candidate validation remains O(n) in memory; physical persistence is bounded independently. Unknown candidate properties are stripped and unsampled final ids do not train affinity."
  "2026-09-05T10:01:55.553Z","harness:codex","Operational verification before PR: Sentry 14-day unresolved query completed with no omitted pages and zero issues; the required reliability gate passed with critical=0 high=0 telemetry finish error rate=1.04 percent and zero failures without error codes. These are live pre-merge checks, not claims about an unpublished artifact."
  "2026-09-05T10:18:21.280Z","harness:codex","Verification diagnosis: reproducible-process fixtures used PM_TELEMETRY_ENABLED=0, which the runtime does not recognize. Their intended telemetry opt-out was ineffective and real process steps varied from seconds to minutes. Replaced it with the existing canonical disabled/OTEL-disabled/prompt controls and disabled host Ollama auto defaults, matching the shared temporary fixture policy. Timing thresholds and real CLI/MCP execution remain unchanged."
  "2026-09-05T10:39:15.155Z","harness:codex","Installed-artifact acceptance: npm pack of this checkout installed independently with npm and Bun in disposable directories. Both completed 21 CLI operations including parent and children reads, exact duplicate parity, claim/update/comments/notes/learnings/files, linked public-SDK acceptance in explicit tracker sandbox context, structured close/release and clean history validation. Public SDK verified three complete items, duplicate analysis, 10000 candidate rows sampled to 256, final delivery validation and physical ledger ceiling. Local npx and bunx execute version 2026.9.5 in both installations. No real tracker was used by these tests."
  "2026-09-05T10:56:04.666Z","harness:codex","Full coverage reached exact 100/100/100/100: 59977 lines, 62379 statements, 12940 functions, 47268 branches, zero uncovered. One of 8442 tests failed: real agent-task replay exceeded 180 seconds (856.7 seconds observed) because its subprocess environment used ineffective PM_TELEMETRY=0. Corrected the actual telemetry opt-out controls without changing timeout or transcript assertions. The concurrent benchmark now also exports empirical nearest-rank p50 and p95 lock waits alongside minimum and maximum."
  "2026-09-05T11:04:53.733Z","harness:codex","Final independent scale rerun: 40 serves across four concurrent SDK tasks per workspace. At 10000/100000/1000000 rows: 46.73/20.82/1.92 serves per second; mean written bytes 18137.75/18149.225/18134.675; minimum lock waits 3.11/18.29/198.10ms, nearest-rank p50 25.15/50.10/809.52ms, p95 84.97/193.86/1367.67ms, maximum 105.66/229.60/1622.77ms. Each tier compacted 2 of 40 serves; physical bytes 237785/237821/237857. These are concurrent tasks sharing the cross-process lock, not four OS processes. Full quality:static passes; final full coverage rerun pending."
  "2026-09-05T11:14:16.229Z","harness:codex","Delivery verification: full sandbox coverage passes 8442 tests in 613 files, exact 100/100/100/100 with zero uncovered (59977 lines, 62381 statements, 12941 functions, 47268 branches). Full quality:static, package-artifact and documentation-link gates pass. Every linked test on all six active owners passes through pm test --run --progress. npm and Bun installed-artifact acceptance passes 21 CLI operations each with public SDK assertions, npx and bunx. GitHub has no open issues, existing PRs or open dependency/code/secret security alerts; dependency audit is clean. Review and exact-head hosted checks remain the next delivery step."
  "2026-09-05T11:20:07.629Z","harness:codex","Reviewed delivery: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1199 contains the combined 52-file SDK/CLI implementation, contracts, tests, documentation and generated changelog. Implementation commit 2cbfbda7c carries passing local full coverage and quality evidence. Use scripts/reviews/pr-review-loop.mjs watch --pr 1199 --repo unbraind/pm-cli --interval 60, inspect all paginated comments/reviews/threads including updatedAt changes, react and reply on the actual surface, and require exact-head hosted analyzer proof before merge. This comment records review routing, not approval or publication."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-05T10:59:06.486Z","harness:codex",Telemetry test isolation must use the runtime-recognized opt-out variables. An unused PM_TELEMETRY or PM_TELEMETRY_ENABLED flag can silently leave real CLI subprocesses waiting on external sinks; preserve transcript assertions and fix isolation instead of increasing test timeouts.
